 "name": "nrfx-vendor",
 "description": "An nRF52840 DK running an application built with Nordic's unmodified nrfx drivers and MDK (tests/vendor/nrfx/run.py puts the image beside this file as sketch.elf): USB power, a button on D2 (P1.03), a terminal on the virtual COM port's pins (P0.06 TX, P0.08 RX) at 115200 baud. A 25LC040 SPI EEPROM on the Arduino SPI pins (D10 CS, D13 SCK, D11 MOSI, D12 MISO), a 24C02 I2C EEPROM at 0x50 on SDA (P0.26) and SCL (P0.27) with 4.7 kOhm pull-ups to VDD, D3 through a 10 kOhm, 4.7 uF low-pass into A0 (AIN1), a 1.0 V source on A1 (AIN2).",
